          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cherry-vibrant/10 text-cherry-vibrant font-label-sm text-label-sm">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cherry-vibrant animate-pulse"></span>
            Canlı B2B Vitrin Ağı
          </span>
          <h1 class="font-headline-xl-mobile text-headline-xl-mobile text-navy-deep mt-1 tracking-tight">İşletmeler Rehberi</h1>
